1
00:00:00,168 --> 00:00:03,208
(Sheldon:)I'm sorry, I bet my sweet what?

2
00:00:03,922 --> 00:00:06,422
(Sheldon:)Well, all right. We're on our way.

3
00:00:07,384 --> 00:00:08,424
(Leonard:)What's going on?

4
00:00:08,593 --> 00:00:12,893
Well, it would seem Amy is drunk
in a liquor-store parking lot.

5
00:00:13,056 --> 00:00:14,386
(Leonard:)Really? Amy?

6
00:00:14,557 --> 00:00:17,397
(Sheldon:)Leonard, be glad you can't keep a woman.
They are a handful.

7
00:00:25,568 --> 00:00:30,198
(Amy:)Oh, look. It's Sheldon and little Leonard.
Hi, Iittle Leonard.

8
00:00:31,533 --> 00:00:33,953
- Hi, Amy.
- Hey, Cuddles.

9
00:00:35,203 --> 00:00:36,243
(Leonard:)Cuddles?

10
00:00:36,413 --> 00:00:39,253
(Sheldon:)Yes, Cuddles. We cuddled.
Grow up, Leonard.

11
00:00:42,043 --> 00:00:43,423
(Leonard:)Amy, what are you doing here?

12
00:00:43,586 --> 00:00:45,756
(Amy:)Well, I came here
to get a bottle of wine...

13
00:00:45,922 --> 00:00:49,132
(Amy:)...like Penny taught me to do
when you're sad.

14
00:00:50,260 --> 00:00:52,890
(Leonard:)Yeah, but why didn't you go back
to your apartment?

15
00:00:53,054 --> 00:00:57,394
Didn't you go to high school?
Parking lots are where cool kids hang out.

16
00:00:57,559 --> 00:01:01,019
(Amy:)Not that the rat bastards
ever invited me.

